#. (itstool) path: simplesect/para
#: Ada_Zangemann.dbk:547
msgid ""
"Adults and children loved his inventions. All the kids wanted to have one of his skateboards — complete with the latest sounds to show off to their friends at school. Kids also loved his speaker invention, which could instantly play any song you requested. And, of course, everyone loved the ice cream served every afternoon from the automatic, extra-delicious Original Zangemann "
"Ice Cream Machine. It all seemed like magic, but the secret was simple: the little computers that Zangemann built into his machines made it all possible."
msgstr ""
"Adultos e crianças adoravam suas invenções. Todas as crianças queriam ter um "
"de seus skates — completo com os sons mais recentes para mostrar para seus "
"amigos na escola. As crianças também adoravam a invenção do alto-falante, "
"que podia tocar instantaneamente qualquer música que pedissem. E, claro, "
"todos adoravam o sorvete servido todas as tardes da máquina de sorvetes "
"automática extra-deliciosa Máquina de Sorvetes Original de Zangemann. Tudo "
"parecia magia, mas o segredo era simples: os pequenos computadores que "
"Zangemann construiu em suas máquinas tornavam tudo isso possível."

