#. (itstool) path: simplesect/para
#: Ada_Zangemann.dbk:959
msgid ""
"In the days that followed, they talked from morning to night and designed their first programs for the government’s computers. They were no longer disturbed by Zangemann’s calls. Toni had the good idea of reprogramming the telephones. When Zangemann called, he only heard an automated recording: “The government only wants to use software that it can freely use, study, share, and "
